  "description": "Agricultural field boundaries for five Brazilian states (Goiás, Pará, Piauí, São Paulo, Tocantins) and Paraguay (Chaco and non-Chaco), delineated from Sentinel-2 imagery by the Trazo2 model for the 2023–2024 planting season. Trazo2 is the best evaluated and characterized model in the suite. Files are named {model}_{country}_{region}_{year}; read them all with the glob trazo2-fields/*.parquet. Full-attribute GeoPackages for desktop GIS are in geopackages/.",
